<title>JAPAN: NEC says to keep 16 MB DRAM price unchanged in Feb.</title>
<headline>NEC says to keep 16 MB DRAM price unchanged in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEC Corp senior executive vice president Hajime Sasaki said on Thursday that the company would keep its current 16 megabit DRAM prices for volume users unchanged in February.</p>
</text>
